":23972802,"text":"Ehrr?","nextNodeIds":[751450120]},{"nodeId":751450120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1855206962,"text":"You said you saw some strange words before... Umm, Paimon didn't see anything, so she can't be sure, but... might they have been written by the same person?","nextNodeIds":[751450121]},{"nodeId":751450121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":654776714,"text":"I think that's the case, yes...","nextNodeIds":[751450122]},{"nodeId":751450122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1433923938,"text":"But, this time you also saw... a giant section of ruins, and the Abyss...","nextNodeIds":[751450123]},{"nodeId":751450123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2088449658,"text":"And some \"Sacred Mountain\"... Hmm, don't the Natlanese call that volcano the \"Sacred Mountain\"? Could it be that what you saw has something to do with the volcano?","nextNodeIds":[751450124]},{"nodeId":751450124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3571411930,"text":"#Paimon can't shake the feeling that the person who united us with {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} really wants us to go there...","nextNodeIds":[751450125]},{"nodeId":751450125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1813145322,"text":"#Maybe that's where we'll find the answers to {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}'s origins... We might even meet his family...","nextNodeIds":[751450126]},{"nodeId":751450126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":1073916914,"text":"Rawr!","nextNodeIds":[751450127]},{"nodeId":751450127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3302053762,"text":"Anyway... Paimon thinks we should keep an ear out for information about the volcano.","nextNodeIds":[751450128]},{"nodeId":751450128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":457189802,"text":"Hmm. Come to think of it, one of the six tribes of Natlan, the Collective of Plenty, lives beside it, don't they? Maybe we can ask them for help!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":751450112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3695906650,"text":"The true identity of the cake murderer is... Paimon!","nextNodeIds":[751450113]},{"nodeId":751450113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":813759978,"text":"Rawr!","nextNodeIds":[751450114]},{"nodeId":751450114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3117893874,"text":"Darn it! How did you know? Paimon was certain no one saw her eating Little Miss Cake... Just kidding, Paimon actually stole the Blazed Meat Stew!","nextNodeIds":[751450115]},{"nodeId":751450115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1375051642,"text":"So, you... Wait, what did you just see?","nextNodeIds":[751450116]},{"nodeId":751450116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2330650050,"text":"(You explain what you saw to Paimon...)","nextNodeIds":[751450117]},{"nodeId":751450117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3739109514,"text":"So, you saw some weird words again...","nextNodeIds":[751450118]}]},{"talkId":7514502,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"para